{"4090310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Primal Repairs", "steam_appid": 4090310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a prehistoric world where being a handyman is the job of the future!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Primal Repairs</i> you play as a craftsman who can fix absolutely anything. An open world full of absurd contracts awaits you - cavemen in need, and dinosaurs that serve not only as pets but also… as tools of the trade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the sprawling Stone Age city, take on increasingly bizarre repairs, and upgrade your home and workshop. Jump into your car, visit new districts, and tackle jobs that demand creativity, strength… and a touch of prehistoric ingenuity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090310/extras/6aabc18c4fe9dc38e25621ad311ea73d.poster.avif?t=1786542336\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090310/extras/6aabc18c4fe9dc38e25621ad311ea73d.webm?t=1786542336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090310/extras/6aabc18c4fe9dc38e25621ad311ea73d.mp4?t=1786542336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your loyal <strong>Velly </strong>always follows you and gladly lends a hand—or a claw. He can replace a jack, a drill, or even a hammer. Just give him the signal and he’ll get the job done—watch him haul heavy loads with those tiny, funny little arms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090310/extras/80eacbda3d4cefd75f05ec6f71badfae.poster.avif?t=1786542336\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090310/extras/80eacbda3d4cefd75f05ec6f71badfae.webm?t=1786542336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090310/extras/80eacbda3d4cefd75f05ec6f71badfae.mp4?t=1786542336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 dinosaur species</strong> – use them for mowing the lawn, heating up food, or carrying heavy loads.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open world</strong> – travel by car, explore districts, and discover new repair contracts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prehistoric vibe</strong> – a civilization that evolved in its own funny way, full of quirky devices and dino-machines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090310/extras/868f308b3e9bd726f97bf60faf92b75f.poster.avif?t=1786542336\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090310/extras/868f308b3e9bd726f97bf60faf92b75f.webm?t=1786542336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090310/extras/868f308b3e9bd726f97bf60faf92b75f.mp4?t=1786542336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to take on the challenge as the ultimate Stone Age handyman?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primal Repairs will grab you like a Tyrannosaurus seizing its prey!</p>